   "title": "Set up",
   "text": "\\[\\begin{aligned}&\\sqrt{18}=\\sqrt{9\\times 2}=3\\sqrt{2}\\\\[5pt]&\\frac{4}{\\sqrt{2}}=\\frac{4}{\\sqrt{2}}\\times \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{\\sqrt{2}}=4\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}=2\\sqrt{2}\\\\[5pt]&\\text{Length }=2+\\sqrt{18}=2+3\\sqrt{2}\\\\[5pt]&\\text{Width }=5-\\frac{4}{\\sqrt{2}}=5-2\\sqrt{2}\\\\[5pt]&\\text{Area }=\\text{ Length }\\times \\text{ Width}\\\\[5pt]&\\quad =(2+3\\sqrt{2})(5-2\\sqrt{2})\\\\[5pt]&\\quad =10-4\\sqrt{2}+15\\sqrt{2}-6(\\sqrt{2})^{2}\\\\[5pt]&\\quad =10+11\\sqrt{2}-12\\\\[5pt]&\\quad =-2+11\\sqrt{2}\\end{aligned}\\]",
